nergy, and Others. The company offers telecom power solutions include power management solutions, such as switch mode power supply, power management unit, integrated power management unit, hybrid DC power system; solar solutions, including charge control unit, inverters, power boosters, AC-DC converters and remote monitoring, and management solutions; battery energy storage solutions, such as lithium-ion battery systems, containerized BESS integration, power conversion systems, energy management systems, monitoring and analytics, and energy control platforms. It also engages in telecom, energy, ICT, and smart infrastructure, as well as provides lifecycle services. The company serves telecom network operators and tower infrastructure providers, state electricity boards and power distribution utilities, electricity generation companies, and private B2B customers in industrial, commercial, and EPC segments. Pace Digitek Limited was incorporated in 2007 and is based in Bengaluru, India.","employees":1537,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795440735},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795440734,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Pace Digitek\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"PACE DIGITEK LIMITED Share Price","s":"Upstox","d":1795161600,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE5uTGZKWTdtRU93elo2VHZVcmxJLXl3VGFwVmc5ZmowTHo1ZXdvb2VLSm1NdHRULU92RmhLRnRhdlY1bEVjNWtldGJkcE5kTDA4NHpkMEpxMmFpMHpweDRYemNiU3VOcFlVaWpJ?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Pace Digitek to build 1.8 GWh BESS at NTPC Khavda solar plant","s":"Solarbytes","d":1795006170,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxPU2VEczUtbkRndldlTlVUZTNNMU9qaUFzaWtxUU11elJHRmd0NGF3WVFJb3g3T01RQ3RUTWhobUMzcm41UmpXbF9Dcm5pWVVWYnNtcE9uMW81eHBBS0dxVDRlZEs2N2JJd1RsRHhvMm1UYmRLeW5ta3V4ZEUteUh2M21vQVN0ZklCNjdRRjZIM2JFQjVMeUQzV21XNlluWkkxRW5Tc25SYktrT29DNE93QnJ0aUtHakJjZ0g4Q29UVmZJWnZ3Z2E4?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Pace Digitek Subsidiary Re